## Register and publish

```bash
mdb register {{ model_id }}
mdb publish {{ model_id }} -d <your-destination>
```

Or do both in one step with `mdb ship {{ model_id }}`. The publishing destination can also come from `SAS_PUBLISH_DESTINATION` in your `.env`.
